sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Demo / future controller
    participant F as RestaurantFacade
    participant M as MealCreator
    participant B as Order.Builder
    participant P as PriceCalculator
    participant S as OrderService
    participant K as KitchenObserver
    participant C as CustomerObserver
    D->>F: placeOrder(request)
    F->>M: createMeal()
    M-->>F: Meal
    Note over F: Wrap Meal with Cheese / Sauce
    F->>B: addItem(meal, quantity)
    F->>B: build()
    B-->>F: Order
    F->>P: calculate(order)
    Note over P: Delegate discountFor to DiscountStrategy
    P-->>F: PriceBreakdown
    F->>S: submit(order, price)
    Note over S: Store NEW snapshot
    S->>K: onOrderChanged(NEW)
    S->>C: onOrderChanged(NEW)
    S-->>F: OrderView
    F-->>D: OrderView
    D->>F: updateStatus(id, PREPARING)
    F->>S: updateStatus(id, PREPARING)
    S->>K: onOrderChanged(PREPARING)
    S->>C: onOrderChanged(PREPARING)
    D->>F: updateStatus(id, READY)
    F->>S: updateStatus(id, READY)
    S->>K: onOrderChanged(READY)
    S->>C: onOrderChanged(READY)
